(The migration converted the application's authentication from a cosmetic, client-side gate into a real security boundary. The) Tj
T* (three critical findings of the earlier security review — no RLS, forgeable localStorage sessions, and UI-only role) Tj
T* (enforcement — are closed. Passwords are now handled entirely by a managed auth service, destructive actions are) Tj
