(The trade-offs are modest and mostly ergonomic: synthetic emails rule out email-based flows for now, usernames are) Tj
T* (immutable, and Supabase's password floor replaces the old 'any non-empty' rule. The ongoing costs are small — policy) Tj
T* (maintenance when the schema changes, secret hygiene for the service-role key, and dependency upkeep. At this) Tj
T* (application's scale, the new implementation is cheaper to operate than the old one was to secure.) Tj
